  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When the given mixture is shaken with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>amine get protonated and becomes a cation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo></msup></math><br />which does not dissolve in an organic solvent&nbsp;<br />since,&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0b34f7ee-906b-4fde-99a1-e105be8c321e-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 146px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1e6cd737-9608-44ab-93ee-e2622dcf8dfc-image.png\" style=\"width: 460px; height: 156px;\" /></p>",
